					"content": "派蒙，其实现有的四篇诗歌里，已经包含了黑主的故事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400570611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 400570611,
					"content": "咦，真的吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400570612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400570612,
					"content": "事情的关键，就在于葵之翁看到墨染清洗诗集后写出的那首诗。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400570613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "温迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 400570613,
					"content": "少女在溪边清洗赤人诗集的情景，对于普通人来说，完全不明所以。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400570614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "温迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 400570614,
					"content": "甚至就连葵之翁也不明白，墨染的行动意味着什么。他只是单纯地睹物思人，回忆起了故交。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400570615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "温迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 400570615,
					"content": "不过，对于陷害赤人的犯人来说就不一样了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400570616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "温迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 400570616,
					"content": "只有他担心，如果这首诗被将军看到，将军就有可能发现赤人抄袭事件的真相，那他可就要完蛋了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400570617
					],
					"speakerTitle": "温迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 400570617,
					"content": "所以，他才会铤而走险，威胁葵之翁把那首诗撕下来。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400570618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "温迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 400570618,
					"content": "原来那个威胁葵之翁的家伙，就是陷害了赤人的犯人！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400570619
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400570619,
					"content": "这个犯人正是「黑主」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400570620
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400570620,
					"content": "什么，他就是「黑主」？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400570621
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400570621,
					"content": "对，因为这些诗作虽然只有四篇，却讲述了「五歌仙」的故事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400570622
					],
					"speakerTitle": "温迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 400570622,
					"content": "既然诗中的将军肯定不是歌仙，剩下的出场角色，就只有那个身份不明的神秘人咯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400570623
					],
					"speakerTitle": "温迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 400570623,
					"content": "听你们解释过之后，我现在总算是都明白了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400570624
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400570624,
					"content": "不过，现在我在想另一件事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400570625
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 400570625,
					"content": "五歌仙的故事情节，和我们周围发生的事都有或多或少的联系。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400570626
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 400570626,
					"content": "那么在现实当中，会不会也有这样一个「黑主」存在呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400570627
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 400570627,
					"content": "现实中的…「黑主」？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400570628
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400570628,
					"content": "说起来，万叶他是不是想到了些什么呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400570629
					],
					"speakerTitle": "温迪"
				},
				{
					"id": 400570629,
					"content": "万叶？对啊，好像从刚才开始，他就变得特别沉默，我们过去问问他吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400570604,
					"content": "你好像很苦恼。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400570605
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4005707,
			"completionStepIds": [
				4005714
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"4005714",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 4005714,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
